# bigboy image pins (CHAOS-9962): the ONLY place the digests of ci/bigboy/compose.bigboy.yml live. Pass it after ops/.env:
#   docker compose ... --env-file ops/.env --env-file _records/bigboy-pins.env -f ci/bigboy/compose.bigboy.yml ...
# bigboy-repin.sh and bigboy-repin-web.sh rewrite the running copy _records/bigboy-pins.env at every cut (and write BIGBOY_OPERATOR_IMAGE into it);
# this tracked copy is the last pin a PR recorded, not the build bigboy runs now. BIGBOY_OPERATOR_IMAGE (the workers) is exported by the cut.
